avMerge">Merge</a><a class="nav-link" href="/sign-pdf" data-i18n="navSign">Sign</a><a class="nav-link" href="/protect-pdf" data-i18n="navProtect">Protect</a></div><div class="nav-right"><select class="nav-select" id="langSelect" aria-label="Language"><option value="en">English</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="fr">Français</option><option value="de">Deutsch</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="ar">العربية</option><option value="hi">हिन्दी</option><option value="bn">বাংলা</option><option value="ur">اردو</option></select><button class="nav-icon-btn" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode"><svg class="icon-moon" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13.5A8 8 0 0 1 10.5 4 6.8 6.8 0 1 0 20 13.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><svg class="icon-sun" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.4M12 19.1v2.4M2.5 12h2.4M19.1 12h2.4M5 5l1.7 1.7M17.3 17.3 19 19M19 5l-1.7 1.7M6.7 17.3 5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><a class="nav-link desktop-link" href="#" data-i18n="desktop">Desktop</a></div></nav><div class="usp-strip" aria-label="Key benefits"><span class="usp-item">🔒 <b>100% Private</b> — files never leave your device</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">🆓 <b>Free Forever</b> — all 34 tools, no limits</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">⚡ <b>No Signup</b> — start instantly</span></div><section class="hero"><h1>Compress PDF Online Free</h1><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>Compress PDF</span></nav><section class="seo-content"><p class="geo-answer" style="background:#faf7ef;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;border-left:4px solid #b08d2e;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 18px"><strong>Short answer:</strong> To compress a PDF for free, open TheEditPDF's Compress PDF tool, choose your PDF, pick a quality level (Smallest, Balanced, or Sharper), and download the smaller file. Scanned and image-heavy PDFs often shrink by 70–90% with no visible difference on screen. No signup is needed, and the file never leaves your browser.</p><h2>Make PDFs smaller for email and upload</h2><p>Oversized PDFs get rejected by email servers, application portals, and messaging apps. TheEditPDF's free Compress PDF tool shrinks your file by re-rendering pages at screen-friendly resolution, with three quality levels: Smallest file, Balanced, and Sharper. Everything runs locally in your browser — your document is never sent to a server.</p><h3>How to compress a PDF</h3><ol><li>Choose your PDF file.</li><li>Pick an image quality: Smallest, Balanced (recommended), or Sharper.</li><li>Click "Compress &amp; download" and check the result.</li></ol><h3>What to expect</h3><p>Scanned documents and image-heavy PDFs often shrink by 70&ndash;90% with no visible difference on screen. Text-based PDFs compress less because there is little image data to optimize. Note that compression flattens pages into images, so selectable text and form fields are not preserved in the output — keep your original if you need those.</p><p class="faq-q">Which quality should I choose?</p><p>Balanced suits almost everything. Choose Smallest for quick sharing where perfect sharpness doesn't matter, and Sharper when the PDF will be printed.</p><p class="faq-q">Is there a maximum file size?</p><p>The limit is your device's memory rather than a fixed number. Files of a few hundred megabytes generally process fine on a desktop.</p><p class="faq-q">Can I compress a PDF twice?</p><p>You can, but each pass re-renders the images, so quality drops a little every time. Compress once from the original at the quality you need.</p><p class="faq-q">Why didn't my file shrink much?</p><p>Files that are mostly text with few images have little to optimize. The biggest wins come from scanned pages and embedded photos.</p>
