></span><svg class="arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h2 data-i18n="t_pdfjpg_t">PDF to JPG</h2><p data-i18n="t_pdfjpg_d">Export every PDF page as a sharp JPG image.</p></button><button class="tool" data-tool="numbers"><span class="tool-icon"><svg width="25" height="25" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h9l4 4v14H6V3Zm9 0v5h4M9 17h1l1-5H9m4 5h2a1 1 0 0 0 0-2h-2l2.5-3H13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><svg class="arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h2 data-i18n="t_numbers_t">Add page numbers</h2><p data-i18n="t_numbers_d">Number pages neatly at the top or bottom.</p></button><button class="tool" data-tool="watermark"><span class="tool-icon"><svg width="25" height="25" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16M8 5l4 14 4-14M6 16h12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><svg class="arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h2 data-i18n="t_watermark_t">Watermark PDF</h2><p data-i18n="t_watermark_d">Stamp text across every page of your document.</p></button><button class="tool" data-tool="images"><span class="tool-icon"><svg width="25" height="25" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16v14H4V5Zm3 10 3-3 2 2 2-2 3 3M8 9h.01" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><svg class="arrow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><h2 data-i18n="t_image