avMerge">Merge</a><a class="nav-link" href="/sign-pdf" data-i18n="navSign">Sign</a><a class="nav-link" href="/protect-pdf" data-i18n="navProtect">Protect</a></div><div class="nav-right"><select class="nav-select" id="langSelect" aria-label="Language"><option value="en">English</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="fr">Français</option><option value="de">Deutsch</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="ar">العربية</option><option value="hi">हिन्दी</option><option value="bn">বাংলা</option><option value="ur">اردو</option></select><button class="nav-icon-btn" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode"><svg class="icon-moon" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13.5A8 8 0 0 1 10.5 4 6.8 6.8 0 1 0 20 13.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><svg class="icon-sun" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.4M12 19.1v2.4M2.5 12h2.4M19.1 12h2.4M5 5l1.7 1.7M17.3 17.3 19 19M19 5l-1.7 1.7M6.7 17.3 5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><a class="nav-link desktop-link" href="#" data-i18n="desktop">Desktop</a></div></nav><div class="usp-strip" aria-label="Key benefits"><span class="usp-item">🔒 <b>100% Private</b> — files never leave your device</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">🆓 <b>Free Forever</b> — all 34 tools, no limits</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">⚡ <b>No Signup</b> — start instantly</span></div><section class="hero"><h1>OCR Scanned PDF Online Free</h1><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>OCR PDF</span></nav><section class="seo-content"><p class="geo-answer" style="background:#faf7ef;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;border-left:4px solid #b08d2e;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 18px"><strong>Short answer:</strong> To OCR a scanned PDF for free, open TheEditPDF's OCR tool, choose a scanned PDF, JPG, or PNG, and click Run OCR. The Tesseract recognition engine, loaded on demand in your browser, reads the text out of scans and images and hands you a plain-text file. Your files never leave your device.</p><h2>Turn scans into searchable text with OCR</h2><p>Scanned PDFs and photos of documents are just pictures — you can't search them, copy from them, or translate them. TheEditPDF's free OCR tool uses the Tesseract recognition engine, loaded on demand in your browser, to read the text out of scans and images and hand you a plain-text file. Your files never leave your device, which matters for sensitive paperwork.</p><h3>How to OCR a PDF or image</h3><ol><li>Choose a scanned PDF, JPG, or PNG.</li><li>Click "Run OCR" and wait while the engine loads (first run downloads the recognition data).</li><li>Download the extracted text.</li></ol><h3>Getting the best results</h3><p>OCR accuracy depends on scan quality: straight, high-contrast pages at 300 DPI recognize far better than crooked phone photos. Clean English documents typically come out nearly perfect; unusual fonts, handwriting, and heavy background noise will need proofreading. The tool currently recognizes English text.</p><p class="faq-q">How long does OCR take?</p><p>A few seconds per page on a typical laptop after the one-time engine download. Large scans take proportionally longer.</p><p class="faq-q">Does OCR preserve the layout?</p><p>No — you get the recognized text as plain text, in reading order. For layout-preserving conversion, that remains a job for desktop software.</p><p class="faq-q">Is my scan uploaded anywhere?</p><p>Never. The recognition engine runs inside your browser tab.</p>
