n="navCompress">Compress</a><a class="nav-link" href="/merge-pdf" data-i18n="navMerge">Merge</a><a class="nav-link" href="/sign-pdf" data-i18n="navSign">Sign</a><a class="nav-link" href="/protect-pdf" data-i18n="navProtect">Protect</a></div><div class="nav-right"><select class="nav-select" id="langSelect" aria-label="Language"><option value="en">English</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="fr">Français</option><option value="de">Deutsch</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="ar">العربية</option><option value="hi">हिन्दी</option><option value="bn">বাংলা</option><option value="ur">اردو</option></select><button class="nav-icon-btn" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode"><svg class="icon-moon" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13.5A8 8 0 0 1 10.5 4 6.8 6.8 0 1 0 20 13.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><svg class="icon-sun" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.4M12 19.1v2.4M2.5 12h2.4M19.1 12h2.4M5 5l1.7 1.7M17.3 17.3 19 19M19 5l-1.7 1.7M6.7 17.3 5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><a class="nav-link desktop-link" href="#" data-i18n="desktop">Desktop</a></div></nav><div class="usp-strip" aria-label="Key benefits"><span class="usp-item">🔒 <b>100% Private</b> — files never leave your device</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">🆓 <b>Free Forever</b> — all 23 tools, no limits</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">⚡ <b>No Signup</b> — start instantly</span></div><section class="hero"><h1>Free Online PDF Editor</h1><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>PDF Editor</span></nav><section class="seo-content"><h2>Edit PDFs directly in your browser</h2><p>TheEditPDF's free PDF editor lets you change a PDF without installing software or creating an account. Click any existing text to edit it in place — the editor samples the original font, size, and color so your change blends in. You can also add brand-new text anywhere on the page, insert images, draw shapes, highlight passages, add links, fill in form fields, and place your signature. Everything happens locally in your browser, so confidential contracts, tax forms, and personal documents never leave your device.</p><h3>How to edit a PDF</h3><ol><li>Open the editor — it starts automatically on this page.</li><li>Choose your PDF file when prompted.</li><li>Click existing text to edit it, or pick a tool from the toolbar (Text, Images, Sign, Shapes, Annotate).</li><li>Drag elements to reposition them and use the side panel to fine-tune formatting.</li><li>Click Download PDF and choose to save, print, rename, or keep editing.</li></ol><h3>Why edit with TheEditPDF?</h3><p>Most free editors stamp watermarks on your file or force a signup before downloading. TheEditPDF does neither. There are no watermarks, no accounts, and no upload queues — your file is processed on your own computer, which is also faster than waiting on a remote server. The editor works on phones and tablets too, with a touch-friendly toolbar.</p><p class="faq-q">Will my edits look like the original text?</p><p>Yes. When you click existing text, TheEditPDF reads the surrounding font family, size, and color from the page and applies them to your replacement automatically.</p><p class="faq-q">Is there a file size limit?</p><p>Because processing is local, the practical limit is your device's memory. Typical office documents of tens or hundreds of pages work fine.</p>
 <!--faq-injected--><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="faq-q">How can I edit a PDF without Adobe?</p><p>Use TheEditPDF&#x27;s free online PDF editor — click any existing text to change it, add new text anywhere, highlight, draw shapes, white out content, fill forms, add images and signatures. No Adobe Acrobat, no signup, no watermark, and your file never leaves your browser.</p><p class="faq-q">How do I fill out a PDF form online?</p><p>Open the free PDF editor, upload your form, and click anywhere to type. You can also tick checkboxes, add dates, insert your signature, and download the filled form — no printing or scanning needed.</p><p class="faq-q">Can I edit a PDF on my iPhone?</p><p>Yes. Open theeditpdf.com/pdf-editor in Safari or Chrome on your iPhone, upload the PDF, and edit it directly — add text, highlight, sign, or fill forms. No app to install.</p><p class="faq-q">Is there a free PDF editor with no watermark?</p><p>Yes — TheEditPDF&#x27;s editor is completely free with no watermark on your output, no signup, and no daily limits. ---</p><div class="related-tools"><h3>Related free PDF tools</h3><ul><li><a href="/sign-pdf">Sign PDF</a></li><li><a href="/merge-pdf">Merge PDF</a></li><li><a href="/compress-pdf">Compress PDF</a></li></ul></div></section><p class="hero-sub" data-i18n="heroSub">Easy, fast and private PDF editor</p><a class="cta-gold" href="/pdf-editor"><span data-i18n="cta">Edit a PDF document – it's free</span> <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="hero-alt"><span data-i18n="heroAlt1">or choose one of our</span> <a href="#tools"><span data-i18n="heroAlt2">23 PDF tools</span> ▾</a></p><p class="hero-privacy"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3M6 10h12v10H6V10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span data-i18n="privacyNote"> Files are processed on your device — nothing is uploaded.</span></p><