avMerge">Merge</a><a class="nav-link" href="/sign-pdf" data-i18n="navSign">Sign</a><a class="nav-link" href="/protect-pdf" data-i18n="navProtect">Protect</a></div><div class="nav-right"><select class="nav-select" id="langSelect" aria-label="Language"><option value="en">English</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="fr">Français</option><option value="de">Deutsch</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="ar">العربية</option><option value="hi">हिन्दी</option><option value="bn">বাংলা</option><option value="ur">اردو</option></select><button class="nav-icon-btn" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode"><svg class="icon-moon" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13.5A8 8 0 0 1 10.5 4 6.8 6.8 0 1 0 20 13.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><svg class="icon-sun" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.4M12 19.1v2.4M2.5 12h2.4M19.1 12h2.4M5 5l1.7 1.7M17.3 17.3 19 19M19 5l-1.7 1.7M6.7 17.3 5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><a class="nav-link desktop-link" href="#" data-i18n="desktop">Desktop</a></div></nav><div class="usp-strip" aria-label="Key benefits"><span class="usp-item">🔒 <b>100% Private</b> — files never leave your device</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">🆓 <b>Free Forever</b> — all 34 tools, no limits</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">⚡ <b>No Signup</b> — start instantly</span></div><section class="hero"><h1>PDF to Excel Online Free</h1><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>PDF to Excel</span></nav><section class="seo-content"><p class="geo-answer" style="background:#faf7ef;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;border-left:4px solid #b08d2e;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 18px"><strong>Short answer:</strong> To convert a PDF to Excel for free, open TheEditPDF's PDF to Excel tool, choose your PDF, and click Convert to Excel. Text is pulled into a real .xlsx spreadsheet you can sort, filter, and calculate with — processed entirely in your browser, so your data never leaves your device.</p><h2>Extract PDF tables into an Excel spreadsheet</h2><p>Copy-pasting tables out of PDFs destroys their structure. TheEditPDF's free PDF to Excel tool pulls text from your PDF into a real .xlsx spreadsheet you can sort, filter, and calculate with — processed entirely in your browser, so your data never leaves your device.</p><h3>How to convert PDF to Excel</h3><ol><li>Choose your PDF file.</li><li>Click "Convert to Excel".</li><li>Download the .xlsx file and open it in Excel, Google Sheets, or LibreOffice.</li></ol><h3>What to expect</h3><p>The tool extracts text row by row into spreadsheet cells, which works beautifully for clean, text-based tables like statements and price lists. PDFs with complex multi-column layouts or merged cells may need light tidying afterward — a quick column adjustment beats retyping hundreds of rows. Scanned PDFs need OCR first, since they contain images rather than text.</p><p class="faq-q">Will numbers stay as numbers?</p><p>Extracted values come through as text in most cases; use your spreadsheet's "convert to number" if you need calculations.</p><p class="faq-q">Can it handle multi-page tables?</p><p>Yes — text from all pages flows into the sheet in order.</p><p class="faq-q">What about password-protected PDFs?</p><p>Unlock the file first with the Unlock PDF tool, then convert the unlocked copy.</p><p class="faq-q">Is my financial data safe?</p><p>Completely — conversion runs locally in your browser and nothing is transmitted to any server.</p>
