avMerge">Merge</a><a class="nav-link" href="/sign-pdf" data-i18n="navSign">Sign</a><a class="nav-link" href="/protect-pdf" data-i18n="navProtect">Protect</a></div><div class="nav-right"><select class="nav-select" id="langSelect" aria-label="Language"><option value="en">English</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="fr">Français</option><option value="de">Deutsch</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="ar">العربية</option><option value="hi">हिन्दी</option><option value="bn">বাংলা</option><option value="ur">اردو</option></select><button class="nav-icon-btn" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode"><svg class="icon-moon" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13.5A8 8 0 0 1 10.5 4 6.8 6.8 0 1 0 20 13.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><svg class="icon-sun" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.4M12 19.1v2.4M2.5 12h2.4M19.1 12h2.4M5 5l1.7 1.7M17.3 17.3 19 19M19 5l-1.7 1.7M6.7 17.3 5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><a class="nav-link desktop-link" href="#" data-i18n="desktop">Desktop</a></div></nav><div class="usp-strip" aria-label="Key benefits"><span class="usp-item">🔒 <b>100% Private</b> — files never leave your device</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">🆓 <b>Free Forever</b> — all 34 tools, no limits</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">⚡ <b>No Signup</b> — start instantly</span></div><section class="hero"><h1>Extract Text from PDF Online Free</h1><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>PDF to Text</span></nav><section class="seo-content"><p class="geo-answer" style="background:#faf7ef;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;border-left:4px solid #b08d2e;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 18px"><strong>Short answer:</strong> To extract text from a PDF for free, open TheEditPDF's PDF to Text tool, choose your PDF, and click Extract text. All the selectable text is pulled into a clean plain-text file in seconds. It runs entirely in your browser, so private documents never leave your device.</p><h2>Extract text from any PDF</h2><p>Copying text out of a PDF one page at a time is tedious. TheEditPDF's free PDF to Text tool pulls all the selectable text from your document into a clean plain-text file in seconds. It runs entirely in your browser, so private reports and personal documents never leave your device.</p><h3>How to extract text from a PDF</h3><ol><li>Choose your PDF file.</li><li>Click "Extract text".</li><li>Download the resulting .txt file.</li></ol><h3>What you get</h3><p>The output preserves the reading order of the document's text layer — headings, paragraphs, and lists come out as plain text you can paste into Word, Google Docs, notes apps, or translation tools. It is ideal for quoting sources, feeding text to screen readers, or archiving content in a format that will open anywhere in fifty years.</p><p class="faq-q">What about scanned PDFs with no text layer?</p><p>Plain extraction only works when the PDF contains real text. For scans and photos of documents, use the OCR PDF tool instead — it recognizes the text in images.</p><p class="faq-q">Will formatting like bold and tables be kept?</p><p>Plain text carries no formatting. Tables come out as spaced text that usually needs tidying. For editable formatting, try PDF to Word.</p><p class="faq-q">Is there a page limit?</p><p>No fixed limit. Very long documents (hundreds of pages) extract fine; the only constraint is your device's memory.</p>
