 <p>Like almost every website, our hosting provider (Vercel) may log basic technical information such as your IP address, browser type, and pages visited, for security and reliability. We also use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand aggregate, anonymous usage — for example, which tools are popular. Google Analytics uses cookies and may collect your IP address, browser type, and pages visited; it does not receive your documents. We do not use advertising trackers or fingerprinting scripts of our own. You can opt out of Google Analytics with Google's opt-out browser add-on.</p>
-<h2>4. Third-party libraries</h2>
+<h2>4. Advertising and cookies</h2>
+<p>We do not currently display advertisements on TheEditPDF. In future, we may show ads served by Google AdSense. If ads are shown, Google and its advertising partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to this site and other sites, and to measure ad performance. You can opt out of personalised advertising through Google's Ads Settings, and you can manage cookies in your browser settings. Your documents are never shared with advertisers, and no advertising partner receives your files.</p>
+<h2>5. Third-party libraries</h2>
 <p>TheEditPDF loads open-source JavaScript libraries (for example pdf.js and pdf-lib) from public content delivery networks (CDNs). Those CDNs may see a standard request for the library file, exactly as when any site loads a font or script. They do not receive your documents.</p>
-<h2>5. Children</h2>
+<h2>6. Children</h2>
 <p>TheEditPDF is a general-purpose utility not directed at children under 13, and we knowingly collect no personal information from anyone.</p>
-<h2>6. Your control</h2>
+<h2>7. Your control</h2>
 <p>Because files never reach us, there is nothing to request, correct, or delete on our side. Clearing your browser data removes any trace of your session from your device.</p>
-<h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
+<h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
 <p>If we materially change how TheEditPDF handles information, we will update the date above and describe the change here.</p>
-<h2>8. Contact</h2>
-<p>Questions about this policy can be sent through the contact details published on the TheEditPDF homepage.</p>
