avMerge">Merge</a><a class="nav-link" href="/sign-pdf" data-i18n="navSign">Sign</a><a class="nav-link" href="/protect-pdf" data-i18n="navProtect">Protect</a></div><div class="nav-right"><select class="nav-select" id="langSelect" aria-label="Language"><option value="en">English</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="fr">Français</option><option value="de">Deutsch</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="ar">العربية</option><option value="hi">हिन्दी</option><option value="bn">বাংলা</option><option value="ur">اردو</option></select><button class="nav-icon-btn" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode"><svg class="icon-moon" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13.5A8 8 0 0 1 10.5 4 6.8 6.8 0 1 0 20 13.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><svg class="icon-sun" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.4M12 19.1v2.4M2.5 12h2.4M19.1 12h2.4M5 5l1.7 1.7M17.3 17.3 19 19M19 5l-1.7 1.7M6.7 17.3 5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><a class="nav-link desktop-link" href="#" data-i18n="desktop">Desktop</a></div></nav><div class="usp-strip" aria-label="Key benefits"><span class="usp-item">🔒 <b>100% Private</b> — files never leave your device</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">🆓 <b>Free Forever</b> — all 34 tools, no limits</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">⚡ <b>No Signup</b> — start instantly</span></div><section class="hero"><h1>Redact PDF Online Free</h1><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>Redact PDF</span></nav><section class="seo-content"><p class="geo-answer" style="background:#faf7ef;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;border-left:4px solid #b08d2e;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 18px"><strong>Short answer:</strong> To redact a PDF for free, open TheEditPDF's Redact PDF tool, choose your PDF, and drag on any page to draw black boxes over sensitive areas. Click Download redacted PDF to get a new PDF with those areas permanently burned in. Everything happens in your browser — the file is never uploaded.</p><h2>Black out sensitive information in a PDF</h2><p>Sharing a document but need to hide names, account numbers, or addresses first? TheEditPDF's free Redact PDF tool lets you drag black boxes over anything sensitive, then downloads a new PDF with those areas permanently burned in. Everything happens in your browser — the file is never uploaded, which is exactly what you want when handling confidential material.</p><h3>How to redact a PDF</h3><ol><li>Choose your PDF file.</li><li>Drag on any page to draw black boxes over sensitive areas. Navigate between pages with Prev / Next.</li><li>Use "Clear page" or "Clear all" if you need to start over.</li><li>Click "Download redacted PDF".</li></ol><h3>How redaction works here — read this</h3><p>On download, each page is flattened into an image with your black boxes burned in, then rebuilt into a fresh PDF. That means the covered content is truly gone from the output — it can't be selected, copied, or revealed. The trade-off: pages become images, so text in the downloaded file isn't selectable. <strong>Always open the downloaded file and verify every box</strong> before sharing; redaction done carelessly is worse than none.</p><p class="faq-q">Is this true redaction?</p><p>Yes, in the practical sense: the output contains no trace of the covered areas. What it is not is a vector-level edit — pages are flattened, which is the standard safe approach for browser tools.</p><p class="faq-q">Can I redact just one page?</p><p>Draw boxes only where needed; pages without boxes pass through (as flattened images) unchanged in appearance.</p><p class="faq-q">Does the original file change?</p><p>No. Redaction produces a new download; your original stays untouched.</p>
