avMerge">Merge</a><a class="nav-link" href="/sign-pdf" data-i18n="navSign">Sign</a><a class="nav-link" href="/protect-pdf" data-i18n="navProtect">Protect</a></div><div class="nav-right"><select class="nav-select" id="langSelect" aria-label="Language"><option value="en">English</option><option value="es">Español</option><option value="fr">Français</option><option value="de">Deutsch</option><option value="pt">Português</option><option value="ar">العربية</option><option value="hi">हिन्दी</option><option value="bn">বাংলা</option><option value="ur">اردو</option></select><button class="nav-icon-btn" id="themeToggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode"><svg class="icon-moon" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13.5A8 8 0 0 1 10.5 4 6.8 6.8 0 1 0 20 13.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><svg class="icon-sun" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M12 2.5v2.4M12 19.1v2.4M2.5 12h2.4M19.1 12h2.4M5 5l1.7 1.7M17.3 17.3 19 19M19 5l-1.7 1.7M6.7 17.3 5 19" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></button><a class="nav-link desktop-link" href="#" data-i18n="desktop">Desktop</a></div></nav><div class="usp-strip" aria-label="Key benefits"><span class="usp-item">🔒 <b>100% Private</b> — files never leave your device</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">🆓 <b>Free Forever</b> — all 34 tools, no limits</span><span class="usp-sep" aria-hidden="true">•</span><span class="usp-item">⚡ <b>No Signup</b> — start instantly</span></div><section class="hero"><h1>Add Watermark to PDF Online Free</h1><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <span>Watermark PDF</span></nav><section class="seo-content"><p class="geo-answer" style="background:#faf7ef;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;border-left:4px solid #b08d2e;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 18px"><strong>Short answer:</strong> To add a watermark to a PDF for free, open TheEditPDF's Watermark PDF tool, choose your PDF, type your watermark text such as CONFIDENTIAL, pick opacity and text size, and click Watermark and download. The text is drawn diagonally across every page, right in your browser — no upload, no account.</p><h2>Stamp a watermark across PDF pages</h2><p>Mark documents as DRAFT, CONFIDENTIAL, or SAMPLE before sharing them. TheEditPDF's free Watermark PDF tool draws your text diagonally across every page with adjustable size and opacity, right in your browser — no upload, no account, no watermark on the watermark tool itself (ironic, we know).</p><h3>How to add a watermark</h3><ol><li>Choose your PDF file.</li><li>Type your watermark text, for example CONFIDENTIAL.</li><li>Pick opacity (Light, Medium, Strong) and a text size.</li><li>Click "Watermark &amp; download".</li></ol><h3>Choosing the right look</h3><p>Light opacity keeps the document fully readable while marking it; Strong makes the stamp unmissable for drafts circulating widely. Medium suits most "confidential" sharing. The watermark sits behind nothing — it is drawn onto each page at a 35-degree angle in a muted red tone that photocopies clearly.</p><p class="faq-q">Can I remove a watermark later?</p><p>Use the PDF editor's whiteout tool to cover it, or re-export from your original unwatermarked file if you still have it.</p><p class="faq-q">Does watermarking change the original text?</p><p>No — existing content is untouched; the stamp is simply added on top of each page.</p><p class="faq-q">Can the watermark say something in another language?</p><p>Yes — any text you can type works, including non-Latin scripts. Very long phrases are fine too, though shorter stamps look cleaner.</p><p class="faq-q">Is the watermark selectable text?</p><p>It is drawn as vector text on each page, so it stays sharp at any zoom level.</p>
